 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat</strong> is a fast-paced asymmetrical multiplayer game to play with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the <strong>Rats</strong> and trash the house... or as the <strong>Exterminator</strong> and wipe them out to the very last one.<br>Jump into matches for 2 to 20 players across varied maps, each packed with its own set of surprises…</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique voice chat...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rats</strong> can talk to each other via voice chat without fear of being understood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Exterminator</strong> only hears squeaks instead of their words!</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal as a Rat:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the target score by destroying and stealing items before the timer runs out, without getting killed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out... every piece of destruction makes noise that will give you away!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the <strong>Exterminator</strong> gives chase,<br>quickly hide inside furniture to escape their sight.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the Exterminator:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>camera</strong> to track the rats' movements and uncover their hiding spots...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your <strong>traps</strong> strategically to slow them down as much as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill</strong> them all!</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of traps are at your disposal,<br>each with its own nasty surprise in store for the <strong>Rats</strong>...</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play match after match to earn <strong>Cheese-Coins</strong>,<br>and spend them on skins to customize your rat!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, which side will you be on?</strong></p></p>",
